# Hardware Proxy

# Third-party firmware catalogs: Samsung, Xiaomi, Apple IPSW and LG KDZ.
# https://samfw.com/ lists MiFirm, IPSW Pro and LGROM as related projects.
# Repeated valid static-resource transfers favor proxy; SamFw requires a web challenge.
# Exact hosts include the escaped spellings observed in client logs.
DOMAIN,samfw.com
DOMAIN,samfw\.com
DOMAIN,samfrew.com
DOMAIN,samfrew\.com
DOMAIN,mifirm.net
DOMAIN,ipsw.pro
DOMAIN,ipsw\.pro
DOMAIN,lgrom.com

# SamFrew download host: provisionally retain the existing proxy path.
# Root health checks are not firmware-throughput measurements; no payload speed claim.
# https://samfrew.com/pricing
DOMAIN,download.samfrew.com
DOMAIN,download.samfrew\.com

# NVIDIA software update/package distribution, including NVIDIA App installers.
# https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5799
# Valid installer byte-range transfers favor proxies; preserve update functionality.
DOMAIN,ota.nvidia.com

# Bambu Lab Wiki comments: scripts, styles and comment APIs share this host.
# https://wiki.bambulab.com/en/home
# Keep comments available through the existing proxy path. Page-view reporting
# shares this HTTPS host and requires site/browser-level control, not a host block.
DOMAIN,artalk.bambulab.com

# eufyMake printer documentation; direct page/style samples were slow or timed out.
# https://wiki.eufymake.com/en/home
DOMAIN,wiki.eufymake.com

# ASUS ROG / Armoury Crate update API (/service/update2); retain the current proxy path.
# GET returns 405 on direct and proxy paths; device-specific update requests are unverified.
# https://rog-forum.asus.com/t5/armoury-crate/rogliveservice-update-fails/td-p/1044038
DOMAIN,rog-live-service.asus.com

# KeebTalk mechanical keyboard forum; actual topic-page transfers favor proxy routing.
# https://www.keebtalk.com/about
DOMAIN,www.keebtalk.com
DOMAIN,www\.keebtalk.com

# Linus Tech Tips hardware forum; automated probes receive an access challenge on all paths.
# No valid page-transfer sample supports changing the existing proxy path to direct.
# https://linustechtips.com/
DOMAIN,linustechtips.com

# NVIDIA Developer Forums: repeated topic-list transfers were faster through proxies.
# Keep the exact forum host separate from NVIDIA metrics and telemetry endpoints.
# https://forums.developer.nvidia.com/
DOMAIN,forums.developer.nvidia.com

# GIGABYTE website: retain proxy routing; automated page requests returned 403
# on both direct and proxy paths, so no direct-performance advantage was verified.
DOMAIN,www.gigabyte.com
DOMAIN,www\.gigabyte.com

# MonitorControl website and Sparkle appcast; exact exception to the ad keyword
# "monitor". This business list is evaluated before the merged ad rules.
# https://github.com/MonitorControl/MonitorControl/blob/main/MonitorControl/Info.plist
# Complete update-feed transfers favored proxies; GitHub release hosts stay separate.
DOMAIN,monitorcontrol.app
